answers.workaround:
It can be implemented fairy simply (or at least scrolling only),
I'm not sure why I need to divide relative value by 2, same code in `func _input(event)` works without it O_o
```
extends ItemList

func _ready():
	connect("gui_input", self, "_gui_input")

func _gui_input(event):
	if event is InputEventScreenDrag:
		var relative : Vector2 = event.relative
		var scroll : VScrollBar = get_v_scroll()
		scroll.value -= relative.y/2
```
